---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - Otaku Blitz">
  <main class="flex-grow">
    <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[var(--color-primary)]/15 to-[var(--color-secondary)]/15 py-14 md:py-20">
      <div class="section-container max-w-4xl text-center">
        <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--color-accent-lavender)]">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="gradient-text text-4xl font-black tracking-tight md:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base">Last updated: September 20, 2026</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-12 md:py-16">
      <div class="section-container max-w-4xl">
        <article class="card space-y-8">
          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text)]">What we collect</h2>
            <p>Otaku Blitz collects only what is needed to run the games and leaderboard. This may include the nickname you choose, a player identifier, your game progress, best scores, and any name, email address, or message you send through the contact form.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text)]">How information is used</h2>
            <p>We use this information to create your player profile, save game progress, display leaderboard entries, respond to contact messages, and maintain the site. We do not sell personal information.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text)]">Browser storage and third parties</h2>
            <p>Your player identity, progress, and local best scores are stored in your browser using localStorage. Leaderboard and contact-form requests are sent to our Google Apps Script service, which may store the submitted information in Google services used to operate Otaku Blitz.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text)]">Your choices</h2>
            <p>You can clear local game information at any time through your browser settings. If you would like to request removal of information submitted through the contact form or leaderboard, please <a class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-accent-lavender)] hover:underline" href="/contact">contact us</a>.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text)]">Changes to this policy</h2>
            <p>We may update this policy as Otaku Blitz evolves. Any change will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
